WEBVTT

00:00:02.510 --> 00:00:05.680
Everyone, when you're watching Deltora Quest,

00:00:05.680 --> 00:00:09.100
Make sure you're in a well- lit room and sit far away from the TV!

00:00:17.260 --> 00:00:23.970
When I open this door
Kono doa akereba atarashii sekai ga

00:00:24.720 --> 00:00:27.860
A brand new world is starting right now
Ima hajimarunda

00:00:29.960 --> 00:00:34.440
Even if there are painful things on my way
Tsurai koto ga aru toshitemo

00:00:36.130 --> 00:00:40.840
I will show you that I can overcome them all
Kitto norikoetemiseru

00:00:42.190 --> 00:00:48.600
I'm starting to walk on a brand new world now
Atarashii sekai ni ima arukidashita soko ha

00:00:48.600 --> 00:00:54.830
And I'm sure there are [Dreams] and [Hope] there
[Yume] ya [Kibou] ga aru kara

00:00:54.830 --> 00:00:58.050
This feeling is making my heart beat so fast
Dokidoki suru kono kimochi

00:00:58.050 --> 00:01:01.180
And there's no one who can stop it
darenimo tomerarenai

00:01:01.180 --> 00:01:06.200
My heart is tightening and jumping all over the place
Kyun to hazumu kokoro

00:01:07.370 --> 00:01:10.560
So start flapping your wings from now
Koko kara habataiteiku

00:01:10.560 --> 00:01:13.610
and soar high to the sky up there
ano sora he to takaku

00:01:13.610 --> 00:01:19.580
Aiming for [Tomorrow] and [The Future] beyond
[Ashita] [Mirai] mezashite

00:01:19.580 --> 00:01:22.910
We will definitely grow bigger someday
Itsuka ookiku nareru to

00:01:22.910 --> 00:01:26.180
That's what I believed
sou shinjiteiru no

00:01:26.180 --> 00:01:31.340
That's why, just spread your wings
Dakara tsubasa wo hiroge

00:01:39.800 --> 00:01:54.750
The Japanese Deltora Quest is brought to you in English by ToranSubs

00:01:56.070 --> 00:01:57.500
<i>My name is Lief.</i>

00:01:57.500 --> 00:02:04.070
<i>In order to bring peace back to Deltora, I defeated evil monsters and recovered the topaz, ruby and opal!</i>

00:02:04.070 --> 00:02:07.090
<i>Honestly... You're always just being reckless though.</i>

00:02:07.090 --> 00:02:07.840
<i>Jasmine!</i>

00:02:07.840 --> 00:02:10.040
<i>It's all thanks to me that you even got this far.</i>

00:02:10.040 --> 00:02:11.600
<i>And don't forget about me either.</i>

00:02:11.600 --> 00:02:12.500
<i>Barda!</i>

00:02:14.380 --> 00:02:15.600
<i>Filli! Kree!</i>

00:02:16.450 --> 00:02:20.200
<i>We are in the middle of our journey to search for the seven gems!</i>

00:02:20.200 --> 00:02:24.700
<i>And right now, we're on our way to the
Shifting Sands where the fourth gem is hidden!</i>

00:02:45.360 --> 00:02:46.300
This place is...

00:02:51.580 --> 00:02:55.110
It's the vision that the opal showed me...!

00:02:56.020 --> 00:02:59.510
It's exactly the same... Even down to this buzzing sound...!

00:03:00.420 --> 00:03:02.500
Even though I didn't want this to happen...!

00:03:03.570 --> 00:03:05.100
Barda!

00:03:05.100 --> 00:03:06.680
Jasmine!

00:03:15.390 --> 00:03:17.830
Barda... Jasmine...

00:03:33.150 --> 00:03:34.420
Isn't this Jasmine's...?

00:03:46.250 --> 00:03:47.560
<i>Lief...</i>

00:03:48.480 --> 00:03:49.610
This voice is...!

00:03:49.610 --> 00:03:54.620
<i>Welcome... to the centre of the Shifting Sands...</i>

00:03:54.760 --> 00:03:55.700
Centre...?

00:03:56.380 --> 00:04:00.390
Oh, right... The Hive desires the belt!

00:04:03.370 --> 00:04:05.200
<i>Surrender it!</i>

00:04:05.900 --> 00:04:08.930
You will never be able to escape from the Shifting Sands!

00:04:09.370 --> 00:04:12.440
<i>Now, hand over the belt!</i>

00:04:13.390 --> 00:04:16.100
No way! I'll never give up the belt!

00:04:16.220 --> 00:04:17.900
<i>Give it to me...!</i>

00:04:18.190 --> 00:04:18.810
No!!

00:04:19.980 --> 00:04:20.800
Stay away!

00:04:21.800 --> 00:04:23.000
Stay away!!

00:04:31.330 --> 00:04:32.210
This sound is...?

00:04:41.330 --> 00:04:42.160
Bees...?

00:04:42.370 --> 00:04:45.640
<i>Give me the belt... Give me the belt...!!</i>

00:04:46.260 --> 00:04:48.600
Stop it... Stop it..!!

00:04:57.960 --> 00:04:59.830
<i>Go to sleep...</i>

00:05:00.570 --> 00:05:02.820
<i>Lief of Del...</i>

00:05:11.480 --> 00:05:12.430
Where am I...?

00:05:14.610 --> 00:05:17.310
Morning, Lief. Did you sleep well?

00:05:17.800 --> 00:05:19.310
Here's a change of clothes.

00:05:21.020 --> 00:05:23.700
Mother? What are you doing here...?

00:05:25.250 --> 00:05:29.310
What are you talking about? This is our home, is it not?

00:05:30.430 --> 00:05:31.240
Home...?

00:05:34.480 --> 00:05:35.870
My room...?

00:05:38.570 --> 00:05:41.760
We were waiting for the day when you would return.

00:05:42.250 --> 00:05:43.800
Forgive me.

00:05:44.500 --> 00:05:48.070
Your journey must have been really tough.

00:05:48.070 --> 00:05:50.110
I'm just glad you made it home safely.

00:05:50.980 --> 00:05:51.700
Mother...

00:05:52.940 --> 00:05:54.800
It must have been painful, right?

00:05:58.210 --> 00:06:03.600
You've done more than enough. There's no need for you to endure such dangers any longer.

00:06:03.780 --> 00:06:08.520
Now, just take off the belt, okay? You can be at ease now, Lief.

00:06:08.930 --> 00:06:09.910
Can I really...?

00:06:10.620 --> 00:06:12.010
Of course.

00:06:12.500 --> 00:06:14.110
Now, the belt.

00:06:15.450 --> 00:06:17.730
Okay, Father...

00:06:22.320 --> 00:06:23.100
But...

00:06:23.800 --> 00:06:27.950
What will happen to the Kingdom of Deltora if I give up on my journey?

00:06:28.480 --> 00:06:36.600
There's no need to worry about that. I'm sure that there will be someone else who can gather the gems in your stead.

00:06:36.600 --> 00:06:40.760
That's right. So rest easy and take off the belt, Lief.

00:06:41.270 --> 00:06:43.890
Someone... else...?

00:06:44.610 --> 00:06:45.320
Yes.

00:06:51.680 --> 00:06:52.440
Lief?

00:06:55.690 --> 00:06:56.800
What's the matter?

00:06:58.180 --> 00:06:59.100
This isn't right...

00:07:00.140 --> 00:07:02.980
You're not my mother and father...!

00:07:03.530 --> 00:07:04.400
What?

00:07:04.960 --> 00:07:07.880
Could it be that you have forgotten your mother's face?

00:07:08.340 --> 00:07:09.690
How could I forget?!

00:07:10.460 --> 00:07:12.690
But my mother and father....

00:07:13.460 --> 00:07:19.290
If you were my real mother and father... you would never tell me to take off the belt!

00:07:19.810 --> 00:07:22.760
They would never say that...!

00:07:24.730 --> 00:07:26.800
Take off the belt...

00:07:29.700 --> 00:07:31.250
Take off the belt...

00:07:31.680 --> 00:07:33.500
Remove the belt...

00:07:34.600 --> 00:07:36.750
The belt... Take it off...!

00:07:37.060 --> 00:07:38.400
The belt...

00:07:39.080 --> 00:07:40.800
Mother...? Father...?!

00:08:08.020 --> 00:08:10.110
Lief... Lief...!

00:08:12.580 --> 00:08:13.740
Keep quiet!

00:08:15.360 --> 00:08:16.610
Keep quiet.

00:08:16.920 --> 00:08:18.620
The old woman from the orchard...?

00:08:19.210 --> 00:08:24.160
You shouldn't attack the bees. Use smoke instead, Lief.

00:08:24.570 --> 00:08:25.620
Smoke?

00:08:25.930 --> 00:08:28.280
That's right. Smoke.

00:08:28.880 --> 00:08:29.460
Ouch...!

00:08:29.460 --> 00:08:30.500
Use smoke. Use smoke instead. Use smoke!
Ouch...!

00:08:30.500 --> 00:08:37.070
Use smoke. Use smoke instead. Use smoke!

00:09:03.960 --> 00:09:04.980
Kree!

00:09:12.690 --> 00:09:17.010
If you're here, that means Jasmine and Barda should be nearby, right?

00:09:20.180 --> 00:09:21.490
Thanks, Kree.

00:09:23.680 --> 00:09:28.500
You're trying to tell me that they're both safe, aren't you?

00:09:30.240 --> 00:09:33.340
Let them know that I'm fine as well.

00:09:37.140 --> 00:09:38.120
It's hot...!

00:09:38.520 --> 00:09:40.000
The belt has grown hot!

00:09:43.170 --> 00:09:44.890
Is the gem closer now?

00:09:49.320 --> 00:09:52.100
Is it over there? What is that, I wonder...

00:10:01.300 --> 00:10:04.000
My body... It won't move...!

00:10:11.820 --> 00:10:12.580
Are you alright?

00:10:13.020 --> 00:10:13.720
Barda!

00:10:13.920 --> 00:10:15.510
You sure are a handful, you know?

00:10:17.380 --> 00:10:18.200
Take that!

00:10:28.600 --> 00:10:29.400
Jasmine...

00:10:29.640 --> 00:10:30.620
Thank goodness.

00:10:35.090 --> 00:10:36.700
Forgive me...

00:10:36.700 --> 00:10:38.400
I went and untied that rope...

00:10:40.640 --> 00:10:43.700
I really thought we'd never see each other again.

00:10:44.170 --> 00:10:45.600
We were worried too.

00:10:46.000 --> 00:10:48.300
Enough to lose our minds, in fact.

00:10:48.930 --> 00:10:51.100
But, I'm happy to see that you're safe.

00:10:51.560 --> 00:10:52.110
Yeah.

00:10:53.240 --> 00:10:53.900
Me too.

00:10:54.820 --> 00:10:59.510
Now then, seeing as though we're all together again, how about we get out of here?

00:11:00.160 --> 00:11:03.000
We don't want that monster to come back, do we?

00:11:03.280 --> 00:11:04.560
Most definitely.

00:11:04.560 --> 00:11:08.690
It's okay. It probably won't attack us again.

00:11:08.690 --> 00:11:10.100
Why do you say that?

00:11:13.060 --> 00:11:17.340
As long as we head for that tower, it has no need to attack us.

00:11:17.810 --> 00:11:19.000
What do you mean?

00:11:19.520 --> 00:11:21.000
What even is that?

00:11:21.490 --> 00:11:24.600
It seems to be the centre of the Shifting Sands.

00:11:24.980 --> 00:11:25.920
The centre...?

00:11:26.530 --> 00:11:34.000
That monster... No, the entire Shifting Sands is leading everything that enters here towards that tower.

00:11:34.520 --> 00:11:38.600
That's why we will be fine as long as we are heading for it.

00:11:40.060 --> 00:11:43.050
And I would guarantee that the fourth gem is there, too.

00:11:43.850 --> 00:11:45.600
Is that what the belt is telling you?

00:11:46.200 --> 00:11:46.820
Yeah.

00:11:48.840 --> 00:11:51.090
Then, we'll just have to go there.

00:11:51.200 --> 00:11:54.580
And this time, we won't be untying that rope.

00:12:13.100 --> 00:12:15.750
It gets creepier the closer we get, doesn't it...

00:12:16.380 --> 00:12:18.870
And it seems like it won't be easy to climb...

00:12:19.440 --> 00:12:22.500
And yet, the belt is telling us to climb it.

00:12:46.140 --> 00:12:48.340
This hole goes down really deep...

00:12:48.720 --> 00:12:50.890
It's too dark to see anything down there.

00:12:59.690 --> 00:13:01.100
Will you be alright, Lief?

00:13:02.320 --> 00:13:04.500
We haven't a choice; the belt is hot.

00:13:04.920 --> 00:13:07.690
Then, the fourth gem is really down there, right?

00:13:07.960 --> 00:13:09.880
Yeah, there's no doubt about it.

00:13:12.320 --> 00:13:14.060
What is this noise?

00:13:14.060 --> 00:13:15.900
Yeah, it's really irritating.

00:13:16.320 --> 00:13:17.140
You can hear it?!

00:13:17.640 --> 00:13:18.220
Yeah.

00:13:18.700 --> 00:13:19.310
We can.

00:13:19.980 --> 00:13:25.200
This is the sound that I've been hearing from time to time since we first entered the Shifting Sands.

00:13:26.060 --> 00:13:29.410
So it's finally revealed itself to us too, then...

00:13:30.000 --> 00:13:34.420
This may be their way of welcoming us, but I can't say I'm happy about it.

00:13:35.200 --> 00:13:37.100
But just what kind of sound is this?

00:13:37.700 --> 00:13:38.980
It's the sound of bees.

00:13:39.410 --> 00:13:40.170
Bees?

00:13:45.540 --> 00:13:47.640
Hold on, you two!

00:13:48.140 --> 00:13:48.900
Right!

00:13:49.200 --> 00:13:49.880
Yeah!

00:13:55.220 --> 00:13:57.240
<i>Hand over the belt...!</i>

00:13:57.980 --> 00:13:58.770
The belt...?

00:13:59.420 --> 00:14:02.000
These sure are a strange type of bees.

00:14:02.370 --> 00:14:04.490
<i>Hand over the belt...</i>

00:14:08.560 --> 00:14:09.440
Take this!

00:14:18.230 --> 00:14:19.320
What just happened...?

00:14:20.100 --> 00:14:22.400
The old woman from the orchard said it, right?

00:14:22.900 --> 00:14:24.900
Bees don't like smoke.

00:14:25.400 --> 00:14:27.340
Still, what in the world were those bees?

00:14:27.800 --> 00:14:30.440
They're probably being controlled by The Hive.

00:14:30.440 --> 00:14:31.840
The Hive...?

00:14:32.120 --> 00:14:39.000
The true ruler of the Shifting Sands, including those monsters and the bees, as well as the guardian of the fourth gem.

00:14:39.730 --> 00:14:45.500
First a sorceress, then a giant snake; we've dealt with lots of foes before now,

00:14:45.500 --> 00:14:47.700
But this thing I just don't understand.

00:14:48.340 --> 00:14:51.680
Well, it's thanks to the stone monument that I know this much.

00:14:52.540 --> 00:14:57.100
The writing on it goes like this: "The Shifting Sands. Danger."

00:14:57.710 --> 00:14:59.890
"Death swarms within its rocky wall,

00:15:00.540 --> 00:15:05.610
Where all are one, one will rules all."

00:15:06.500 --> 00:15:16.900
But I wasn't really sure before about the last part, "Below the dead, the living strive. With mindless will to serve The Hive."

00:15:17.860 --> 00:15:22.780
But now that I think about it, I'd say this word refers to a living swarm.

00:15:23.240 --> 00:15:23.960
Swarm?

00:15:24.640 --> 00:15:29.310
A swarm of insects. More specifically, the swarm of bees from earlier.

00:15:30.340 --> 00:15:36.480
I see. So that stone monument was trying to tell us that the Shifting Sands' guardian is a living swarm of bees, then...

00:15:36.710 --> 00:15:38.410
So that's what it meant...

00:15:38.890 --> 00:15:40.970
Barda, Jasmine.

00:15:42.160 --> 00:15:44.200
From this point on, I'll be going alone.

00:15:45.620 --> 00:15:50.020
Very well. We'll pull you up by the rope if something happens.

00:15:56.180 --> 00:15:56.900
Lief!

00:15:57.880 --> 00:16:01.610
Pull on the rope when you're in danger. We'll get you out of there right away.

00:16:01.760 --> 00:16:02.250
Okay.

00:16:02.740 --> 00:16:03.900
Don't worry.

00:16:04.700 --> 00:16:07.380
We'll all remain tied together.

00:16:08.140 --> 00:16:08.800
Yeah.

00:16:30.970 --> 00:16:34.810
The noise is getting louder... The bees must be close...!

00:16:39.400 --> 00:16:43.320
<i>Hand over the belt... Hand over the belt... Hand over the belt... Hand over the belt...</i>

00:16:43.320 --> 00:16:45.420
-Stay away! Stay away!!

00:17:09.540 --> 00:17:13.730
Whoa... So many things have been stashed in this place.

00:17:14.500 --> 00:17:17.520
I see! So that's what that verse meant...!

00:17:18.320 --> 00:17:22.000
"With mindless will to serve The Hive."

00:17:22.960 --> 00:17:31.390
So this is what it means to serve The Hive! The bees are collecting every treasure that falls to the sand!

00:17:32.290 --> 00:17:34.450
This place is effectively a giant beehive.

00:17:40.380 --> 00:17:42.210
Just how many lives have been stolen...

00:17:43.890 --> 00:17:46.290
It's almost literally a Tower of Death...

00:17:53.200 --> 00:17:54.590
The opal is heating up!

00:18:10.200 --> 00:18:11.300
It's the lapis lazuli!

00:18:13.690 --> 00:18:14.600
Of course!

00:18:17.300 --> 00:18:21.800
<i>It is said that the opal has a special relationship with the lapis lazuli,</i>

00:18:22.240 --> 00:18:25.650
<i>The heavenly stone that's said to be able to banish any evil.</i>

00:18:26.500 --> 00:18:31.120
Since it's reacting to it, there's no doubt about it; this must be the lapis lazuli!

00:18:37.150 --> 00:18:37.850
Huh...?

00:18:45.640 --> 00:18:47.630
It will crumble if I remove the gem!

00:18:49.170 --> 00:18:50.720
<i>You can't take it...</i>

00:18:55.320 --> 00:18:57.700
<i>You cannot take the gem from here...!</i>

00:19:02.610 --> 00:19:03.550
Stay away!

00:19:04.200 --> 00:19:05.050
Stay away!!

00:19:08.250 --> 00:19:09.400
Damn it!

00:19:13.390 --> 00:19:17.300
If only I had something to take the lapis lazuli's place before this tower collapses...

00:19:29.180 --> 00:19:31.400
<i>How dare you try to take it...!!</i>

00:19:37.340 --> 00:19:39.010
This is it! The signal!

00:19:39.290 --> 00:19:40.000
Right!

00:19:55.720 --> 00:19:57.000
That's Jasmine's dagger!

00:20:03.840 --> 00:20:04.430
Jasmine...!

00:20:15.560 --> 00:20:18.180
<i>Return what you stole...!</i>

00:20:18.500 --> 00:20:20.580
Barda, Jasmine, hurry!!

00:20:25.340 --> 00:20:27.620
Jasmine, get away from the entrance!

00:20:29.640 --> 00:20:30.410
Barda!!

00:20:39.260 --> 00:20:40.600
<i>I won't let you!</i>

00:20:48.480 --> 00:20:49.390
Lief!!

00:20:53.040 --> 00:20:53.910
Lief!!

00:20:57.310 --> 00:20:59.490
TL Note: Blisters are the projectiles that Grey Guards shoot.
Jasmine! Ready the blister!

00:20:59.490 --> 00:20:59.790
TL Note: Blisters are the projectiles that Grey Guards shoot.

00:21:16.100 --> 00:21:16.800
It's here!

00:21:37.170 --> 00:21:41.760
<i>Lief and his friends have acquired the fourth gem, the heavenly stone, lapis lazuli.</i>

00:21:47.200 --> 00:21:49.190
That was a close call.

00:21:50.660 --> 00:21:52.200
It worked out thanks to you two.

00:21:52.950 --> 00:21:55.700
You stayed right with me, connected from afar.

00:21:56.540 --> 00:21:57.610
Speaking of which...

00:21:59.890 --> 00:22:00.510
Here.

00:22:02.160 --> 00:22:03.530
My dagger...

00:22:10.840 --> 00:22:12.300
Thank you, Lief...

00:22:13.180 --> 00:22:17.100
I'm the one who should be grateful; you're always saving me, after all.

00:22:17.700 --> 00:22:19.810
So if this makes you happy, then I'm glad.

00:22:24.340 --> 00:22:27.110
And with this, there are only three gems left to find!

00:22:35.160 --> 00:22:40.390
Every moment is a gate to fantasia
Every moment is a gate to fantasia

00:22:41.040 --> 00:22:47.690
You just do it to be an shining star
You just do it to be an shining star

00:22:47.690 --> 00:22:51.050
Ooh la la! The gentle wind that's brushing my cheek in the evening
Ooh la la! Yawarakana kaze hoo naderu yuugata

00:22:51.050 --> 00:22:53.560
If you start to walk with your head held high
Moshi kimi ga uemuki arukidasu nara

00:22:53.560 --> 00:22:57.980
The big red sun will surely give its blessing to you
Ooki na akai taiyou ga kimi wo shukufuku shitekureru darou

00:22:57.980 --> 00:23:00.480
If you stay stricken because you stumbled
Nanika ni tsumazuki uchihishigarete

00:23:00.480 --> 00:23:02.780
And keep hanging your head in shame
Moshi kimi ga utsumuitamama nara

00:23:03.070 --> 00:23:05.070
Then you are probably going to miss
Sono kandouteki na ONE SCENE

00:23:05.280 --> 00:23:07.840
That very touching one scene
Nogashite shimau kamoshirenai kara

00:23:07.840 --> 00:23:10.660
HEY NOW ! Everything that lives on this earth
HEY NOW ! Kono chikyuu de ikiru mono subete

00:23:10.660 --> 00:23:13.210
Sea, Sky, Sun that blessed us in these 7 Days
Umi, sora to taiyou megumi no 7 DAYS

00:23:13.210 --> 00:23:16.010
Since when did I get this thirsty?
Itsu kara ka nodo kawakikittamama

00:23:16.010 --> 00:23:18.560
I turned my back to this town and kept walking away
Kono machi wo se ni ue ni ue ni "WALK AWAY"

00:23:18.560 --> 00:23:20.850
No matter how far or deep you look for it
Tooku made oku no oku made

00:23:20.850 --> 00:23:23.730
In the end, it's just a problem that you don't know the answer to
Mitetara kekkyoku wakaranai mondaiten

00:23:23.730 --> 00:23:25.790
Before saying that you can't go on anymore
